        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1909,
        "name": "鹮巷物语·一",
        "desc": "大天狗者，乃凶残暴戾的自大狂也。酒后尤如是。——狸史氏评",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/08/326985891/1fe016744867dd5585d0728a707cda9c_4005315766510043595.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1911,
        "name": "鹮巷物语·二",
        "desc": "家母曾有教谕：美貌的女子多精通骗术。由是举一反三可得：美貌如月光般的女人，其真面目莫非狐妖，要么便是修为不浅化猫婆婆咯。——狸史氏评",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/08/326985891/1fe016744867dd5585d0728a707cda9c_6305591195520489892.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1910,
        "name": "鹮巷物语·三",
        "desc": "俗语有言，招惹雨女哭泣者，必然招致无法解脱的悲哀。——狸史氏评",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/08/326985891/1fe016744867dd5585d0728a707cda9c_8577404471118340117.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1913,
        "name": "鹮巷物语·四",
        "desc": "凡人之可悲，正在于其不自知。至于妖怪嘛，总是缺乏此种悲哀的烦恼。——狸史氏评",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/08/326985891/1fe016744867dd5585d0728a707cda9c_2108466082212353275.png",
